            "created_at": "2025-09-17T19:26:37.321178+00:00",
            "notes": "This is an important round. Sell everything if you need to!\n\n[Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) is a massive part of this build and makes sure you will win a lot of duels EASILY. On top of that, after using your ult, you also basically get a super cheap recall. **Use your death recall very carefully though, using it to bait the enemy team will win rounds!**\n\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) gives you 10% weapon damage and since you are dashing around constantly, you get an additional 15%  by simply being tracer. INSANE value\n\n[Emily's Affection](item_a7a5d492-74cb-45d3-a5f5-a03a36fe5520) gives you survivability each time you recall. If used correctly, you come back with full health AND some extra to make sure you win EVERY 1 v 1.\n\nYou probably have leftover cash. [Pulse Detector](item_79ddef46-8917-4d8f-a123-7ddb589ad3e7) has my preference (an aditional 10% damage)... But any will do to spend your cash!",
